issue.body:
This implements support for multiple subscribers on one subscription.

The work was enabled by @devbharat's suggestion on top of #1767.

This changes the subscription API from:

```
// To subscribe
telemetry.subscribe_gps([](Telemetry::GpsInfo gps_info) {
    std::cout << "Got GPS Info: " << gps_Info << '\n';
});

// To unsubscribe
telemetry.subscribe_gps(nullptr);
```

To the new way:

```
// To subscribe
auto handle = telemetry.subscribe_gps([](Telemetry::GpsInfo gps_info) {
    std::cout << "Got GPS Info: " << gps_Info << '\n';
});

// To unsubscribe
telemetry.unsubscribe_gps(handle);
```

Closes #1637.
